  {
   "evidence": "The frame bundle provides these laws: `OrthonormalFrame/Pullback.lean:75 pullbackLift_id` and `:81 pullbackLift_comp`. `FiniteRank/Pullback.lean:169,175` has `pullback_id` and `pullback_comp`. This file has neither for `SpinStructure.pullback`, which the G4.2 pullback and descent work needs.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Topology/VectorBundle/SpinStructure.lean",
   "fix": "Add `SpinStructure.pullbackId : (s.pullback (ContinuousMap.id X)).Equiv s` and `SpinStructure.pullbackComp (g : C(Y, X)) (f : C(Z, Y)) : ((s.pullback g).pullback f).Equiv (s.pullback (g.comp f))`, both with `toEquiv` the identity on fibres, plus `@[simp]` `_toEquiv` lemmas and their compatibility with `Equiv.pullback`.",
   "issue": "`SpinStructure.pullback` has no characteristic API for pullback along the identity or along a composite, so consumers cannot compare `s.pullback (ContinuousMap.id X)` with `s`, or `(s.pullback g).pullback f` with `s.pullback (g.comp f)`, without unfolding the exposed body.",
   "line": 340
  }
